+//                      at access time. Nothing is cached, snapshotted, copied
+//                      or subscribed to, and reading state never mutates the
+//                      game. Every assert in tests/dsl.json reads only this.
+//   __NMC__.scenario - SIDE EFFECTS, for checkpoint SETUP steps only. It calls
+//                      the page's own functions (startGame / stopGame /
